an><span>待批准</span><span>高优先级</span></div></div></article><article class="catalog-card project-card" data-card-filter="current agent teamflow" data-od-id="project-card-parallel-nodes"><div class="catalog-icon" aria-hidden="true">并</div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>Workflow</span><strong>并行任务节点</strong></div><p>前端实现、测试生成、文档更新并行执行，输出进入共享 Context。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span>小队队列</span><span>3/6</span><span>运行中</span></div></div><span class="status success">运行中</span></article><article class="catalog-card project-card" data-card-filter="current gate teamflow" data-od-id="project-card-github-auth"><div class="catalog-icon" aria-hidden="true">GH</div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>MCP</span><strong>GitHub MCP 授权</strong></div><p>读取 Issue 前需要 Owner 确认；失败后进入重试 1/3。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span>小队队列</span><span>待授权</span><span>Gate</span></div></div></article><article class="catalog-card project-card" data-card-filter="current handoff teamflow" data-od-id="project-card-audit-archive"><div class="catalog-icon" aria-hidden="true">档</div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>Handoff</span><strong>产物与审计归档</strong></div><p>节点完成后保留文件、报告、权限使用和敏感访问记录。</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span>小队队列</span><span>交付中</span><span>180 天</span></div></div><span class="status">待完成</span></article><div class="filter-empty-state" data-filter-empty="" hidden="">没有匹配项</div></section><section class="workspace-grid"><section class="page-panel" data-od-id="project-execution-inline"><div class="panel-head"><h3>Workflow 执行队列</h3><span class="status warn">可中断</span></div><div class="compact-list" id="project-log" aria-live="polite"><article class="capability-row is-priority"><div><strong>需求确认 Gate</strong><p>展示任务分解、角色分配、预估时长；批准后进入并行执行。</p></div><span class="status">待完成</span></article><article class="capability-row"><div><strong>并行任务节点</strong><p>前端实现、测试生成、文档更新并行执行，输出进入共享 Context。</p></div><span class="status success">运行中</span></article><article class="capability-row"><div><strong>GitHub MCP 授权</strong><p>读取 Issue 前需要 Owner 确认；失败后进入重试 1/3。</p></div><span class="status">待完成</span></article><article class="capability-row"><div><strong>产物与审计归档</strong><p>节点完成后保留文件、报告、权限使用和敏感访问记录。</p></div><span class="status">待完成</span></article></div></section><aside class="side-rail" data-od-id="project-flow-inspector-inline"><section class="rail-panel"><div class="panel-head"><h3>执行状态机</h3><span class="status">6 态</span></div><div class="step-list"><div class="step-row done"><span></span><strong>pending · 排队</strong></div><div class="step-row done"><span></span><strong>initialized · 已解析</strong></div><div class="step-row active"><span></span><strong>running · 并行执行</strong></div><div class="step-row active"><span></span><strong>waiting_approval · Gate</strong></div><div class="step-row"><span></span><strong>completed · 交付</strong></div><div class="step-row"><span></span><strong>failed/retrying · 恢复</strong></div></div></section><section class="rail-panel"><div class="panel-head"><h3>节点类型</h3><span class="status">start/task/gate</span></div><div class="compact-list"><div class="capability-row"><div><strong>start -&gt; task</strong><p>接收需求后拆成可执行节点。</p></div><span class="status">核心</span></div><div class="capability-row"><div><strong>parallel -&gt; merge</strong><p>并行分发给多个角色，合并为共享上下文。</p></div><span class="status">并行</span></div><div class="capability-row"><div><strong>gate -&gt; end</strong><p>人类确认关键决策，再进入交付或回退。</p></div><span class="status warn">卡点</span></div></div></section><section class="rail-panel"><div class="panel-head"><h3>最小上下文</h3><span class="status success">已锁定</span></div><p>只传 PRD 能力域、当前页面壳、审批策略，不把完整历史对话塞给 Agent。</p></section></aside></section></div></section><section class="shell-view shell-page-view" data-filter-scope="" data-od-id="shell-view-team" data-shell-view="team" hidden=""><div class="page-stack" data-filter-scope=""><header class="catalog-market-header function-market-header" data-od-id="team-header-inline"><div class="catalog-mode-tabs" role="group" aria-label="团队视图筛选"><button aria-pressed="true" class="filter-chip mode-tab active" data-filter="office" data-filter-group="team-mode" type="button"><span>办公室</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter="workflow" data-filter-group="team-mode" type="button"><span>协作流</span></button></div><div class="catalog-header-actions"><label class="catalog-search" aria-label="搜索办公室"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg><input placeholder="搜索办公室、目标或成员" type="search" value=""/></label><button class="button" type="button">同步真实数据</button><button class="button primary" type="button" data-team-action="office" disabled="">创建办公室</button></div></header><section class="team-office-shell" data-card-filter="office" data-office-shell="" data-od-id="team-office-shell"><div class="office-card-grid" data-office-list="" aria-label="办公室卡片"><section aria-labelledby="_R_1af_" class="team-office-empty" data-office-empty-state="unavailable"><header class="team-office-empty-head"><span class="team-office-empty-kicker">CONTROL OFFICE</span><h3 id="_R_1af_">Office 定义暂不可用</h3><p>Control Office 定义暂时无法读取，系统会自动重试；不会使用演示数据替代。</p></header><footer class="team-office-empty-footer"><span class="team-office-connection-state" data-state="unavailable" role="status">等待自动重试</span></footer></section></div><section class="office-room-inline team-office-runtime-room" data-office-room="" hidden="" tabindex="-1"><div class="team-office-room-loading" role="status">正在读取 Office 定义…</div></section></section><section class="team-workflow-shell" data-card-filter="workflow" data-od-id="team-workflow-shell" data-workflow-shell="" hidden=""><section class="team-office-empty team-capability-live-empty"><h2>协作流服务暂不可用</h2><p>CrewON Control 未提供 Workflow authority。</p></section></section><div id="team-log" class="sr-log" aria-live="polite"></div></div></section></section></section></section>"`;

